# GitHub Pages publishes every tracked file at siyangni.com/<path>.
# Nothing below should ever be world-readable.

# Everything not used by the published site: CV working files (peer-review
# proofs, superseded Word CV), showcase source (R scripts, .rds fits, raw
# recordings), job-market statements, original unstripped photos, the
# syllabus PDF, and other staging material. Web-ready copies of anything
# here live under assets/.
removed/

# WSL "downloaded from the internet" alternate-data-stream artifacts.
*:Zone.Identifier

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# Raw video recordings (several GB). Web-sized clips live in assets/video/.
*.MOV
*.mov
